{"created": "2026-10-06T02:09:27.739868+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-06T02:09:31.236104+00:00", "id": 23086637, "conceptrecid": "23086636", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23086637", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23086636", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23086637", "metadata": {"title": "Alignment depth and the structure prediction of partner proteins of phage reverse transcriptases: data for checking the reported results", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23086637", "publication_date": "2026-10-03", "description": "<p>Data accompanying the manuscript &quot;Low confidence is not absence: what alignment depth lets structure prediction say about partner proteins of phage reverse transcriptases&quot; (Pyo, AI3 Discovery).</p><p>The deposit is deliberately minimal: it contains what is needed to check and re-derive the results reported in the manuscript. Contents: README.md (layout and verification); manuscript_en.pdf and manuscript_ko.pdf (English and Korean versions of the manuscript); core.tar.gz (figures, the number files NUMBERS.json and NUMBERS_D13.json, the sequences of all analysed proteins, per-stage result tables, and integrity records: the SHA-256 of every file, the verifier verify_release.py, hash commitments for the pre-registration documents and for the withheld files); one &lt;stage&gt;.tar.gz with its &lt;stage&gt;.members.sha256 for each analysis stage (predicted structures in PDB format from AlphaFold2-multimer v3 and Boltz-2, the multiple sequence alignments given to the predictors, confidence outputs, Foldseek hit tables, per-window score tables); CHECKSUMS_TOPLEVEL.sha256.</p><p>Analysis and scoring code, calibrated threshold files and the texts of the pre-registration documents are not deposited; their SHA-256 hashes and git commit identifiers are included so that they can be checked if they are disclosed later. All structures are predictions; no claim about enzymatic activity is made. The git history behind the commitments is a local record without an external timestamp; the date of this deposit is the first external timestamp.</p><p>To verify: download all files into one folder, run <code>tar xzf core.tar.gz</code>, then <code>python3 integrity/verify_release.py .</code> (standard library only). Public inputs used and not redistributed: ColabFold server alignments, Logan protein clusters (s3://logan-pub), PDB entries, Pfam-A 38.2. Third-party tools and data keep their own licenses.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Pyo, Chulmin", "affiliation": "AI3 Discovery"}], "keywords": ["reverse transcriptase", "phage", "GNAT", "structure prediction", "multiple sequence alignment depth", "AlphaFold2", "Boltz-2", "Foldseek", "Logan", "pre-registration"], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23086636"}}]}}, "title": "Alignment depth and the structure prediction of partner proteins of phage reverse transcriptases: data for checking the reported results", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23086637", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23086637", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23086637?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23086637", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23086637", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23086637", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23086637/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23086636", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23086636", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23086636", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23086636", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23086637/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23086637/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23086637/files", "media